{"id":589,"title":{"romaji":"Denpa Onna to Seishun Otoko","english":"Ground Control to Psychoelectric Girl","native":"電波女と青春男"},"slug":"denpa_onna_to_seishun_otoko","synopsis":"Makoto Niwa just moved to the city to live with his aunt Meme after his parents were reassigned to work overseas. He is perfectly fine with that, saying it will give him the chance to live the dream life of an adolescent boy. He keeps track of the things he does by assigning \"points\" to them—positive or negative—and adds them up on a regular basis to grade his adolescent life.\n\nAnd then he discovers Meme has a secret daughter (and self-proclaimed alien) named Erio. He finds her rolling around by the front door of Meme's house wrapped up in a futon. It is then he realizes that his dream adolescent life will not come true, and begins a life of experiences that are out of this world.\n\n(Source: NIS America)","format":"TV","season":"SPRING","year":2011,"createdAt":"2021-03-27 00:43:40","updatedAt":"2021-03-28 01:25:11","resources":{"nodes":[{"site":"MAL","externalId":9379},{"site":"ANILIST","externalId":9379},{"site":"KITSU","externalId":5710},{"site":"ANIDB","externalId":7903},{"site":"ANN","externalId":11808},{"site":"ANIME_PLANET","externalId":3421},{"site":"HULU","externalId":null},{"site":"OFFICIAL_SITE","externalId":null},{"site":"X","externalId":null},{"site":"CRUNCHYROLL","externalId":null}]},"images":{"nodes":[{"id":1173,"facet":"LARGE_COVER","path":"anime/large-cover/rDE5fQiPpxKZMlfjKZZtlkpBDcB59MiDe0U2mxM6.jpg"},{"id":1174,"facet":"SMALL_COVER","path":"anime/small-cover/lxNxat86KqPa4FfFkJVPSaKygLzdAvDVhXJ1TD64.avif"}]},"studios":{"nodes":[{"id":11,"name":"Shaft","slug":"shaft"}]},"series":{"nodes":[]},"animethemes":[{"id":4226,"slug":"OP1","type":"OP","sequence":null,"song":{"id":4226,"title":{"romaji":"Os-Uchuujin","native":null}},"animethemeentries":[{"id":4826,"version":1,"episodes":null,"nsfw":false,"spoiler":false,"videos":{"nodes":[{"id":3517,"basename":"DenpaOnnaToSeishunOt